- **Grading harness:** `harness/grade_polyglot.py` copies all workdir contents into a temp dir, injects `hidden_tests`, runs `python3 -m pytest -q` with `PYTEST_DISABLE_PLUGIN_AUTOLOAD=1`; parses "X passed"/"Y failed".
